---
import PolicyPage from '../components/PolicyPage.astro';
---

<PolicyPage
  title="Delivery Areas & Times"
  heading="Delivery Areas & Times"
  description="Kins Trendy Collections delivers to any county in Kenya. Delivery fee and time are confirmed with you when you order. Pay with M-Pesa or cash on delivery."
>
  <p>We deliver to any county in Kenya, from Nairobi to upcountry towns.</p>

  <h2>How delivery works</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Choose your items on the website, or message us on WhatsApp.</li>
    <li>We confirm your order, your delivery location and the delivery fee with you.</li>
    <li>We send your order and it is delivered to you.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>Delivery fee</h2>
  <p>
    The delivery fee depends on where you are and what you order, so we quote it for each order.
    You will know the fee before you pay.
  </p>

  <h2>Delivery time</h2>
  <p>
    How long delivery takes depends on your location. We tell you when we confirm your order.
  </p>

  <h2>Payment</h2>
  <p>
    You can pay with M-Pesa or cash on delivery. If you are outside Nairobi, ask us which payment
    option works for your area when you order.
  </p>

  <h2>Shoes and sizes</h2>
  <p>
    For shoes, please send us your size when you order so we can confirm it is available before we
    send it.
  </p>

  <p>See our <a href="/returns">Returns Policy</a> for faulty or wrong items.</p>
</PolicyPage>
